# Design notes for the taskflow core (NOT a coverage target).
# This .log file lives under a dir-covered directory (src/taskflow/core)
# but its extension is not in source-files-format ['.py'], so cdmon
# coverage must NOT count it. It also matches the *.log ignore pattern.

- engine.run() skips dependents of a failed task (fail-fast per branch).
- topological_order() is Kahn's algorithm; ties break by insertion order.
